        "\n",
        "## Learning Workflow\n",
        "\n",
        "Throughout the module, we will follow the same analysis pattern:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Ask a clinical question.\n",
        "2. Inspect and visualise the data.\n",
        "3. Compute an appropriate statistical summary or test.\n",
        "4. Interpret the result.\n",
        "5. Relate the finding back to the biomedical context.\n",
